// SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0
; specs/course/arithmetic-and-dsp.t27 -- the t27 course on arithmetic and DSP on the FPGA
; Source of truth for apps/website/scripts/course-from-spec.mjs (gHashTag/trinity), which reads
; it the way it reads specs/course/course.t27: the constant schema, every test block below, every
; widget in specs/widgets/gallery.t27, every lesson spec compiled clean, the Russian bundle named
; by specs/course/arithmetic-and-dsp-ru.t27. It writes this course into src/lib/course.generated.ts
; (the page at #/arithmetic-and-dsp) and a byte-identical copy of this file at
; public/learn/arithmetic-and-dsp.t27. ASCII only (L3), English only (LANG-EN).

; WHAT THE COURSE IS: course 9 of specs/course/courses.t27, 27 lessons in 9 modules of 3: adding
; numbers, multiplying, fixed point, functions in hardware, signals and sampling, FIR filters,
; multirate, the FFT, and the bench. Every lesson opens one interactive widget and one spec.
; Every widget of the course runs the fn bodies of a gHashTag/t27 spec compiled to WebAssembly
; (public/widgets/<id>/logic.js, held to its spec by scripts/widget-logic.mjs): specs/fpga/dsp/
; adders, multipliers, fixed_point, cordic and signals (written for this course, t27#8990) and
; specs/fpga/bpsk.t27, the modem core whose correlator lesson 25 runs.

; WHAT THE COURSE DOES NOT DO: it says no number of its own. Every number in a lesson is one the
; lesson spec computes and its widget shows; the delays of lessons 1 and 26 are inputs the reader
; sets, labelled as such, not device timing.

; WHY 27: 3 cubed lessons, the size of a TRI-27 word. Changing the shape changes the tests.
; phi^2 + 1/phi^2 = 3 | TRINITY

module arithmetic_and_dsp;

